RECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, EXEMPLARY, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES (INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, PROCUREMENT OF SUBSTITUTE GOODS OR SERVICES; LOSS OF USE, DATA, OR PROFITS; OR BUSINESS INTERRUPTION) HOWEVER CAUSED AND ON ANY THEORY OF LIABILITY, WHETHER IN CONTRACT, STRICT LIABILITY, OR TORT (INCLUDING NEGLIGENCE OR OTHERWISE) ARISING IN ANY WAY OUT OF THE USE OF THIS SOFTWARE, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGE.\n\nOpenLDAP is a trademark of the OpenLDAP Foundation.\n\n<<var;name=\"copyright\";original=\"Copyright 1999-2000, The OpenLDAP Foundation, Redwood City, California, USA. All Rights Reserved.\";match=\".{0,5000}\">> Permission to copy and distributed verbatim copies of this document is granted.\n\n" .

