 class=\"replaceable-license-text\"><span title=\"can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}\"> 2.1</span></var>\n            Naming Conventions. If any of your Modifications do not meet the requirements of the Standard, then\n               you must change the product name so that Grid Engine, gridengine, gridengine.sunsource, and\n               similar naming conventions are not used.\n          </li>\n                  \n<li>\n                     <var class=\"replaceable-license-text\"><span title=\"can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}\"> 2.2</span></var>\n            Compliance Claims. If any of your Modifications do not meet the requirements of the Standards you may\n               not claim, directly or indirectly, that your implementation of the Standards is compliant.\n          </li>\n               \n</ul>\n            </li>\n         \n</ul>\n      </div>\n    ";
