        rdfs:comment                    "This license was released: February 1989. This license identifier refers to the choice to use the code under GPL-1.0-only, as distinguished from the use of code under GPL-1.0-or-later (i.e., GPL-1.0 or some later version). The license notice (as seen in the Standard License Header field below) states which of these applies to the code in the file. The example in the How to Apply These Terms appendix of the license shows the \"or later\" approach.";
