ademark &quot;Creative Commons&quot; or any related trademark or logo of Creative Commons without the prior written consent of Creative Commons. Any permitted use will be in compliance with Creative Commons&apos; then-current trademark usage guidelines, as may be published on its website or otherwise made available upon request from time to time.</p>\n\n      <p>Creative Commons may be contacted at https://creativecommons.org/.</p>\n\n    ";
