ware.  THERE IS ABSOLUTELY NO\n        WARRANTY FOR THIS SOFTWARE.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"optional-license-text\"> \n        <p>Berkeley/Bremen, <var class=\"replaceable-license-text\"><span title=\"can be replaced with the pattern .+\"> 05.04.2009</span></var></p>\n\n        <p>Jutta Degener</p>\n\n        <p>Carsten Bormann</p>\n\n      </div>\n    ";
