        rdfs:comment                    "This version was released: 19 November 2007. This license identifier refers to the choice to use the code under AGPL-3.0-only, as distinguished from use of code under AGPL-3.0-or-later (i.e., AGPL-3.0 or some later version). The license notice (as seen in the Standard License Header field below) states which of these applies to the code in the file. The example in the exhibit to the license shows the license notice for the \"or later\" approach.";
