pos; then-current trademark usage guidelines, as may\n                be published on its website or otherwise made available upon request from time to time. For the avoidance\n                of doubt, this trademark restriction does not form part of the License.</p>\n\n            <p>Creative Commons may be contacted at https://creativecommons.org/.</p>\n\n            </div>\n        ";
