        rdfs:comment                    "This license was released 3 November 2008. The identifier GFDL-1.3-only-invariants should only be used when there are Invariant Sections, Front-Cover Texts or Back-Cover Texts. See GFDL-1.3-only and GFDL-1.3-only-no-invariants for alternatives.";
