ense-text\"><span title=\"can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}\"> *</span></var> a Derivative Work as incorporated in a Collective Work\n                                </li>\n                            \n</ul>\n\n                            <p>You agree to offer to the relevant third party making use of the Work (in either of the alternatives\n                            set out above) a licence to use the Derivative Work on any of the following premises:</p>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style:none\">\n                                \n<li>\n                                    <var class=\"replaceable-license-text\"><span title=\"can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}\"> *</span></var> a licence to the Derivative Work on the same terms and conditions as the\n                                    licence granted to You hereunder; or\n                                </li>\n                                \n<li>\n                                    <var class=\"replaceable-license-text\"><span title=\"can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}\"> *</span></var> a later version of the licence granted to You hereunder; or\n                                </li>\n                                \n<li>\n                                    <var class=\"replaceable-license-text\"><span title=\"can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}\"> *</span></var> any other Creative Commons licence with the same Licence Elements.\n                                </li>\n                            \n</ul>\n                        </li>\n\n<li>\n                            <var class=\"replaceable-license-text\"><span title=\"can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}\"> 2.4.</span></var> This Licence does not affect any rights that the User may have under any applicable\n                            law, including fair use, fair dealing or any other legally recognised limitation or exception to\n                            copyright infringement.\n                        </li>\n\n<li>\n           