ensor.</p>\n\n            <p>Except for the limited purpose of indicating to the public that the Work is licensed under the CCPL, neither party will\n                use the trademark &quot;Creative Commons&quot; or any related trademark or logo of Creative Commons without the prior written\n                consent of Creative Commons. Any permitted use will be in compliance with Creative Commons&apos; then-current trademark\n                usage guidelines, as may be published on its website or otherwise made available upon request from time to time.</p>\n\n            <p>Creative Commons may be contacted at https://creativecommons.org/.</p>\n\n            </div>\n        ";
