        rdfs:comment                    "This license was released March 2000. The identifier GFDL-1.1-only can be used to indicate that this license applies, without asserting whether or not any Invariant Sections, Front-Cover Texts or Back-Cover Texts are present. See GFDL-1.1-only-invariants and GFDL-1.1-only-no-invariants for alternative identifiers that can be used to express explicitly that these sections or cover texts are present or are not present, respectively.";
